# yakuza-kenzan-recomp
===
 Unofficial native PC port of Ryu ga Gotoku Kenzan! (PS3, BLJM60064) for Linux and Windows. Statically recompiled with ps3recomp and rendered with Vulkan, with the English fan translation, 30/60/120 FPS options and a launcher that installs from your own copy of the game. No game files included..
